WEBVTT

00:06:29.819 --> 00:06:31.388
A recent study shows that women

00:06:31.421 --> 00:06:34.624
are not as good as men
at negotiating for themselves.

00:06:34.658 --> 00:06:37.294
And yet, women outperform men

00:06:37.327 --> 00:06:40.063
when they negotiate
on behalf of someone else.

00:06:41.031 --> 00:06:43.867
This is because women
who negotiate for themselves

00:06:45.135 --> 00:06:47.437
are perceived as selfish,

00:06:47.470 --> 00:06:50.273
and women who negotiate
on behalf of someone else

00:06:50.273 --> 00:06:52.242
are perceived to be helpful.

00:06:53.176 --> 00:06:58.982
And a helpful woman might be liked more
than a woman who is assertive,

00:06:58.982 --> 00:07:01.551
but the helpful woman
will not be recognized